BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Together
DTSTART:20250724T020000Z
DTEND:20250724T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20250724T020000Z
UID:NWI9dBe9Rp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nYears into their relationship\, 
 Tim and Millie (Dave Franco and Alison Brie) find themselves at a crossroa
 ds as they move to the country\, abandoning all that is familiar in their 
 lives except each other. With tensions already flaring\, a nightmarish enc
 ounter with a mysterious\, unnatural force threatens to corrupt their live
 s\, their love\, and their flesh. July 23 Early Access screening - Mini po
 ster giveaways courtesy of Neon\, while supplies last. Note: No Open Capti
 ons on July 29.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/together
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
