 lexandra on a wild night in L.A. filled with sassy repartee ("Merry Christ
 mas Eve\, bitch")\, adultering pimps\, nightclub debuts\, and capital "d" 
 D-RAMA! Featuring exclusive content from Sean Baker and Samantha Quan\, in
 cluding a post-film Q&A.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/tanger
 ine
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
