 nst a horde of bandits who have warned they will return when the crops are
  ripe. A gripping three-hour ride from master filmmaker Akira Kurosawa. 4
 K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-kurosawa-
 retrospective/seven-samurai
